    map:rationale "Associate resources with their origins and processing history."@en .

<https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/dama-fair-mapping.ttl#area-alignment/metadata-management/direct/R1.3> a owl:NamedIndividual,
