    map:applicabilityCondition "Inspect resource-linked discovery and reuse descriptions covering meaning, methods, coverage, assumptions and limitations. A presentation without associated resource descriptions is insufficient."@en ;
    map:assessmentStatus "Proposed; no implementation or compliance asserted"@en ;
    map:evidenceRequirement "Inspect resource-linked discovery and reuse descriptions covering meaning, methods, coverage, assumptions and limitations. A presentation without associated resource descriptions is insufficient."@en ;
    map:fromPractice <https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/dama-fair-mapping.ttl#activity/BigDataDataScience/row-9> ;
    map:rationale "Communications can make discovery and reuse context available if findings are accompanied by accurate descriptions linked to the analytical resources."@en ;
    map:targetsPrinciple fair:R1 ;
    map:viaPractice map:PublishRichReuseDescriptions .

<https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/dama-fair-mapping.ttl#contribution/DataHandlingEthics/row-2/indirect/A1.2> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        map:IndirectContribution ;
    rdfs:label "Review Data-Handling Practices → A1.2"@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/DAMA-PDOC_FAIR-MASTER_2026-11-16_V3.xlsx#DataHandlingEthics!A2:L2> ;
    map:alignmentBasis "Activity-derived proposal"@en ;
    map:applicabilityCondition "Inspect approved policy or control requirements that explicitly distinguish access authorization from permitted reuse. Test any resulting authentication and authorization procedure for identified resources (A1.2) and inspect the clear, accessible usage licence attached to data and metadata (R1.1). An ethics statement, privacy notice or generic compliance metric alone is insufficient."@en ;
    map:assessmentStatus "Proposed; no implementation or compliance asserted"@en ;
    map:evidenceRequirement "Inspect approved policy or control requirements that explicitly distinguish access authorization from permitted reuse. Test any resulting authentication and authorization procedure for identified resources (A1.2) and inspect the clear, accessible usage licence attached to data and metadata (R1.1). An ethics statement, privacy notice or generic compliance metric alone is insufficient."@en ;
    map:fromPractice <https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/dama-fair-mapping.ttl#activity/DataHandlingEthics/row-2> ;
    map:rationale "Review can identify gaps in authorized access and permitted reuse if the review criteria explicitly include them."@en ;
    map:targetsPrinciple fair:A1.2 ;
    map:viaPractice map:ConfigureRetrievalAuthorization .

<https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/dama-fair-mapping.ttl#contribution/DataHandlingEthics/row-2/indirect/R1.1> a owl:NamedIndividual,
