    map:rationale "Risk assessment can establish requirements for controlled access and clear reuse permissions; neither requirement is specified by the activity label alone."@en ;
    map:targetsPrinciple fair:A1.2 ;
    map:viaPractice map:ConfigureRetrievalAuthorization .

